<title>USA: Gelman, Memtec set merger pact.</title>
<headline>Gelman, Memtec set merger pact.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR, Mich. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Memtec Ltd and Gelman Sciences Inc said on Friday they had signed a definitive merger agreement for their previously announced stock-swap deal.</p>
<p>Ann Arbor-based Gelman and Memtec of Windsor, Australia, announced an agreement in principal in July. Under the agreement, Gelman common holders will receive 1.05 Memtec American Depository Shares for each outstanding Gelman share.</p>
<p>If the average closing price of Memtec depository shares falls below $30 each, Gelman may terminate the deal.</p>
</text>
